<span style="font-weight:bold; color:#e6a23c;">CLIENT-SPAWNED (stdio)</span>
<blockquote class="inline_help">
stdio transport does not run as a background daemon — your MCP client (IDE) spawns the
process per-session, typically over SSH. There is no service to start or stop here.
Use the client configuration snippet below.
</blockquote>
